| **2** | **Andaz Ottawa Byward Market** (Boutique, 4‑star, Marriott) | • **King‑Bed Deluxe** (2 adults) <br>• **Two‑Bedroom Suite** (2 adults + 1 extra adult on sofa‑bed) | **$260‑$310** | Situated in the lively **ByWard Market** district; rooftop terrace with city views, modern design, well‑equipped gym. | Hip, youthful vibe; excellent for groups; strong reviews for service and location. |
